# Local reference sources and generated design artifacts
/Sample_previous_code/
/zwt-finance-ui-prototype/*.png
/zwt-finance-ui-prototype/.npm-cache/

# JavaScript
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vite/
**/coverage/
**/.npm-cache/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Python
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.pip-cache/
**/*.egg-info/
*.py[cod]
# setuptools / `python -m build` 产物，内容是 app/ 的逐字副本，不入库。
**/build/lib/
/zwt-finance-system/backend/build/

# Secrets and local runtime state
**/.env
# frontend/.env.example 明确指引用户复制成 .env.local 做本地覆盖，
# 该文件必须和 .env 一样留在本地。
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
!**/.env.example
**/attachments/
**/backups/
**/logs/
**/runtime/

# Local tooling
# .claude/ 放的是本机的 launch.json / settings.local.json，以及 git worktree
# 本体（.claude/worktrees/）。不入库，也避免误 `git add .` 把整个 worktree 加进来。
/.claude/
/.local/
/.tmp/
/.playwright-mcp/
**/.playwright-cli/
**/.playwright-daemon/
**/.playwright-localappdata/
# Playwright 等工具写出的截图与临时产物。Build-ZwtRelease.ps1 的 robocopy
# 也用 /XD output 把它排除在发布包外，两处口径一致。
**/output/
# agent 会话工作产物（brainstorm HTML、live config 等），结论已沉淀进
# DESIGN.md / PRODUCT.md / docs/，原始产物不入库。
**/.superpowers/
/.impeccable/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Manual Windows releases are built outside source control
**/releases/
**/current/
